# =============================================================================
# PDF Toolkit
# .gitignore
#
# This repository is a monorepo containing several sub-projects:
#   - pdf-search        : Electron + Flask PDF search/extraction app
#   - pdfm              : PDF merge tool (Python)
#   - pdftoolkit        : integration folder (contains pdf-search, pdfm)
#   - PDF Toolkit       : collection of PDF utilities (Python)
#
# A single root .gitignore is applied to every sub-directory because Git
# patterns are relative to the .gitignore location and naturally match anything
# below it (unless the pattern starts with a slash). No sub-folder .gitignore
# is needed.
#
# NOTE: files already tracked by Git stay tracked after this file is added.
# To stop tracking the noise (e.g. node_modules, .venv) and purge it from
# history, run:  git rm -r --cached .   then commit the result.
# =============================================================================

